1
00:00:03,974 --> 00:00:07,978
<font color="white">我就知道是你 伊多先生</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:09,312 --> 00:00:14,735
<font color="white">我一直被科学特搜队的成员</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和身份不明的敌人追击</font></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:15,402 --> 00:00:17,070
<font color="white">虽然不知道原因</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:18,155 --> 00:00:22,075
<font color="white">不过我总是感到不可思议</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">似乎在被谁引导着</font></font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:22,159 --> 00:00:24,494
<font color="white">你的目的到底是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:24,578 --> 00:00:27,581
<font color="white">你是为了什么才在背后出计谋划？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:27,664 --> 00:00:29,458
<font color="white">看来你们</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:33,378
<font color="white">似乎对我有很大的误解</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:34,004 --> 00:00:37,758
<font color="white">我既没有在暗中密谋</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:37,841 --> 00:00:40,886
<font color="white">也没有带着半点虚假</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:41,428 --> 00:00:45,682
<font color="white">不过只是顺应我应尽的使命罢了</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:46,308 --> 00:00:48,226
<font color="white">应尽的使命？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:51,354
<font color="white">对 我的使命就是</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:00:52,147 --> 00:00:55,525
<font color="white">促进全宇宙的和平</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:25,115 --> 00:02:26,366
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:27,617 --> 00:02:30,036
<font color="white">为了维持宇宙和平</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:34,875
<font color="white">我必须抹杀奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:34,958 --> 00:02:36,126
<font color="white">我不懂</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,879
<font color="white">但是在这科学特搜队</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:39,546 --> 00:02:43,550
<font color="white">创造出新的奥特曼的人是你</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,929
<font color="white">为了杀掉奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,516
<font color="white">所以让新的奥特曼诞生是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:52,726 --> 00:02:55,145
<font color="white">为什么要那么拐弯抹角？</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:55,770 --> 00:02:58,857
<font color="white">我先问你们一个问题</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:02:59,357 --> 00:03:01,818
<font color="white">何谓“奥特曼”？</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:02,777 --> 00:03:07,782
<font color="white">你们真的认为奥特曼是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">保护这颗星球的英雄吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:08,825 --> 00:03:10,285
<font color="white">你想说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:11,745 --> 00:03:14,706
<font color="white">2分57秒</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:14,789 --> 00:03:16,124
<font color="white">你在说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:21,171
<font color="white">假设奥特曼前往各主要国</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:21,254 --> 00:03:26,009
<font color="white">并且发动攻击、瘫痪各国</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:26,509 --> 00:03:28,637
<font color="white">过程所需的时间正是</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:29,638 --> 00:03:32,599
<font color="white">2分57秒</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:33,642 --> 00:03:35,352
<font color="white">你的意思是奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:35,894 --> 00:03:38,939
<font color="white">只要3分钟就能侵略这颗地球？</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:39,522 --> 00:03:44,819
<font color="white">我们原先打算让地球成为</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:44,903 --> 00:03:47,614
<font color="white">星团评议会的一员</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:49,699 --> 00:03:56,248
<font color="white">然而在地球人心里</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">根深蒂固的某种概念</font></font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:03:56,331 --> 00:03:58,250
<font color="white">成为了阻碍</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:05,548 --> 00:04:07,175
<font color="white">上啊 奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:07,259 --> 00:04:11,263
<font color="white">-那即是对奥特曼的信仰</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:15,392
<font color="white">星团评议会无法放任</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:15,475 --> 00:04:19,020
<font color="white">奥特曼那庞大的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:20,438 --> 00:04:23,316
<font color="white">偏颇的正义相当危险</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:30,323
<font color="white">事实上 在这个宇宙里</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就有许多星球及种族</font></font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:31,032 --> 00:04:34,995
<font color="white">毁于奥特曼之手</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:35,745 --> 00:04:39,791
<font color="white">为了阻止那份过火的正义</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:40,458 --> 00:04:46,715
<font color="white">只能除去深植人们心中的概念</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:47,841 --> 00:04:50,385
<font color="white">抹灭奥特曼信仰</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:51,636 --> 00:04:58,643
<font color="white">然后引导地球的人类</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">成为宇宙真正的一员</font></font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:59,436 --> 00:05:03,106
<font color="white">那就是我的职责</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:04,858 --> 00:05:08,445
<font color="white">-那是什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好巨大啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:09,237 --> 00:05:12,032
<font color="white">那是不是积顿？</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:12,574 --> 00:05:15,118
<font color="white">据说打败过以前的奥特曼的积顿？</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:17,620
<font color="white">感觉不太妙吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:18,204 --> 00:05:20,290
<font color="white">召唤积顿前来</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:20,874 --> 00:05:24,669
<font color="white">那也只不过是一种手段罢了</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:25,378 --> 00:05:28,548
<font color="white">既然要抹灭奥特曼信仰</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:29,090 --> 00:05:33,803
<font color="white">那就必须除掉</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:35,013 --> 00:05:40,852
<font color="white">成了灾害的奥特曼 也就是进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:43,813 --> 00:05:45,148
<font color="white">我？</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:45,231 --> 00:05:47,609
<font color="white">够了 不用再说了</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:48,693 --> 00:05:50,820
<font color="white">打倒那家伙就行了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:50,904 --> 00:05:53,948
<font color="white">要召唤积顿出现</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:54,032 --> 00:05:57,118
<font color="white">还要再花上约一天的时间</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:57,202 --> 00:06:01,873
<font color="white">我很期待看到你们战斗的模样</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:01,956 --> 00:06:02,999
<font color="white">伊多</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:04,918 --> 00:06:05,877
<font color="white">可恶</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:24,104 --> 00:06:26,272
<font color="white">都是我的错</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:27,524 --> 00:06:28,608
<font color="white">不</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:29,776 --> 00:06:32,654
<font color="white">这一切是因我而起的</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:33,988 --> 00:06:36,533
<font color="white">若非得有人受责骂</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:37,951 --> 00:06:39,244
<font color="white">绝不会是你</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:40,411 --> 00:06:42,455
<font color="white">凭着我们的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:42,539 --> 00:06:47,168
<font color="white">阻止不了伊多与星团评议会</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:49,003 --> 00:06:51,089
<font color="white">只能将一切</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:51,172 --> 00:06:53,633
<font color="white">托付给新世代了</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:55,802 --> 00:06:57,178
<font color="white">我明白</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:02,892 --> 00:07:04,060
<font color="white">你醒啦？</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:05,311 --> 00:07:06,521
<font color="white">我想你应该饿了吧</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:06,604 --> 00:07:10,191
<font color="white">进次郎呢？他在哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:10,775 --> 00:07:12,068
<font color="white">谁知道</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:12,152 --> 00:07:14,863
<font color="white">我又不是前辈的保姆</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:14,946 --> 00:07:16,239
<font color="white">真是的</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:16,322 --> 00:07:18,491
<font color="white">-等一下 玲奈小姐</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不要阻止我</font></font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:19,075 --> 00:07:22,078
<font color="white">-我不会阻止你的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那是怎样？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:23,121 --> 00:07:26,291
<font color="white">虽然我不知道前辈在哪</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:31,254
<font color="white">不过他一定很需要你的陪伴</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:33,131 --> 00:07:34,424
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:40,138 --> 00:07:43,224
<font color="white">要是变得越来越麻烦我可不管哦</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:43,933 --> 00:07:48,062
<font color="white">麻烦老早以前就有了</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:51,316 --> 00:07:52,484
<font color="white">听得到吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:53,193 --> 00:07:54,360
<font color="white">诸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:55,236 --> 00:07:57,572
<font color="white">你现在最好不要回来</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:57,655 --> 00:07:59,324
<font color="white">公安还驻守在这里</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:00,658 --> 00:08:05,455
<font color="white">我想请你避开他们的耳目</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">准备某些东西 办得到吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:05,538 --> 00:08:06,956
<font color="white">我试试看</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,292
<font color="white">很好 我传清单给你</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:13,004
<font color="white">请问进次郎怎么样了？</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:13,087 --> 00:08:15,215
<font color="white">我跟那小子分头行动</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:16,966 --> 00:08:18,551
<font color="white">他没问题吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:08:19,344 --> 00:08:20,595
<font color="white">很难说</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:38,488 --> 00:08:39,405
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:41,699 --> 00:08:43,159
<font color="white">终于找到你了</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:46,579 --> 00:08:50,124
<font color="white">你这时候在这里做什么啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:50,208 --> 00:08:52,126
<font color="white">那是我要说的</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:54,420
<font color="white">你怎么会在这种地方啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:54,504 --> 00:08:56,172
<font color="white">我找你找了好久</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:57,674 --> 00:08:58,758
<font color="white">找我？</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:59,342 --> 00:09:00,677
<font color="white">我一直在找你</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:02,762 --> 00:09:03,763
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:05,223 --> 00:09:09,519
<font color="white">有话一定要告诉你</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:10,103 --> 00:09:13,147
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:15,191 --> 00:09:16,359
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:09:23,992 --> 00:09:25,785
<font color="white">成为奥特曼了</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:09:31,499 --> 00:09:33,334
<font color="white">-我知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:09:35,211 --> 00:09:36,212
<font color="white">其实啊</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:37,755 --> 00:09:39,882
<font color="white">我也是奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:39,966 --> 00:09:42,510
<font color="white">那件事我很早之前就知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:43,177 --> 00:09:44,095
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:44,178 --> 00:09:46,097
<font color="white">等等 那不是重点</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:46,180 --> 00:09:49,392
<font color="white">我其实不是地球人 而是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:49,976 --> 00:09:51,185
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:51,269 --> 00:09:55,940
<font color="white">正确来说 我算是外星人的混血吧</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:59,485 --> 00:10:01,404
<font color="white">你不惊讶吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:02,113 --> 00:10:02,989
<font color="white">没有啦</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:10:04,532 --> 00:10:08,202
<font color="white">原来我跟玲奈小姐很像啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:08,828 --> 00:10:10,163
<font color="white">什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:10:13,625 --> 00:10:14,792
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:10:16,044 --> 00:10:19,464
<font color="white">也许无法再当人类了</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:10:23,843 --> 00:10:25,053
<font color="white">难怪啊</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:28,640
<font color="white">你听到我是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:10:28,723 --> 00:10:30,433
<font color="white">反应还这么平淡</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:10:31,476 --> 00:10:33,853
<font color="white">我还以为你会更讶异呢</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:10:35,229 --> 00:10:37,231
<font color="white">不是因为那样</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:37,315 --> 00:10:38,483
<font color="white">不然呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:41,319 --> 00:10:42,737
<font color="white">对我来说</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:47,950
<font color="white">不管玲奈小姐是地球人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">或是外星人都无所谓</font></font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:49,035 --> 00:10:50,912
<font color="white">因为你就是你啊</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:54,957
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:56,459 --> 00:10:57,502
<font color="white">不会</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:58,711 --> 00:11:01,464
<font color="white">说实话我本来很担心</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:04,967
<font color="white">你从梅菲斯特手中救了我吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:05,718 --> 00:11:10,890
<font color="white">那时候我总觉得奥特曼好像会到别处</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:11:11,557 --> 00:11:14,394
<font color="white">所以我当时才那么拼命</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:11:17,772 --> 00:11:18,856
<font color="white">谢谢</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:22,235 --> 00:11:25,905
<font color="white">但是现在已经不会再那样忧虑了</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:27,198 --> 00:11:28,658
<font color="white">不管发生什么事</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:29,534 --> 00:11:33,204
<font color="white">进次郎 你还会是你</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:35,873 --> 00:11:37,500
<font color="white">就是说啊</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:39,836 --> 00:11:44,132
<font color="white">我曾经害怕战斗时会伤害到某人</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:44,632 --> 00:11:48,010
<font color="white">或是给大家带来困扰</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:48,761 --> 00:11:52,932
<font color="white">可是比起那些 我最畏惧的是</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:53,933 --> 00:11:55,685
<font color="white">我会失去自我</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:59,063 --> 00:12:00,273
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:12:04,402 --> 00:12:05,403
<font color="white">要出动了</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:12:55,244 --> 00:12:56,329
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:00,666 --> 00:13:01,918
<font color="white">我也要跟你去</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:48,089 --> 00:13:50,091
<font color="white">（紧急事态</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">积顿再次逼近科学特搜队）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:13:50,174 --> 00:13:54,011
<font color="white">外星人的宇宙飞船</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">有一只怪兽正要出现</font></font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:54,095 --> 00:13:56,806
<font color="white">疑似为曾经打败过奥特曼的积顿</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:13:58,015 --> 00:14:01,686
<font color="white">宇宙飞船眼看已经逼近科学特搜队</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:14:01,769 --> 00:14:04,313
<font color="white">积顿几乎已经显现全貌</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:04,939 --> 00:14:09,193
<font color="white">但科学特搜队却依然没有任何动静</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:14:16,868 --> 00:14:18,536
<font color="white">积顿要来了</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:32,008 --> 00:14:33,676
<font color="white">积顿</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:14:43,686 --> 00:14:45,646
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你太晚来了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:45,730 --> 00:14:47,273
<font color="white">你在搞什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:14:47,356 --> 00:14:49,609
<font color="white">都是因为你们在 怪兽才会来大闹</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:49,692 --> 00:14:51,986
<font color="white">你就快点被干掉吧</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:53,070 --> 00:14:57,033
<font color="white">积顿的梦并不是爸的记忆</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:14:57,116 --> 00:14:59,744
<font color="white">而是我的命运</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:15:05,041 --> 00:15:06,792
<font color="white">干得好 积顿</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:15:06,876 --> 00:15:08,628
<font color="white">快点把灾害打倒</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:10,713 --> 00:15:14,383
<font color="white">我已经不会再逃避了</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:31,442 --> 00:15:33,361
<font color="white">我也能帮上忙</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:15:33,945 --> 00:15:36,989
<font color="white">-是新的奥特曼？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-他还有同伴吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:15:37,073 --> 00:15:39,450
<font color="white">一起被积顿击败吧</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:15:44,622 --> 00:15:45,623
<font color="white">糟了</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:16:00,846 --> 00:16:02,431
<font color="white">积顿</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:16:03,474 --> 00:16:05,101
<font color="white">是他保护了我们吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:16:05,184 --> 00:16:06,268
<font color="white">怎么可能</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:16:06,352 --> 00:16:09,605
<font color="white">说到底那家伙才是罪魁祸首啊</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:16:09,689 --> 00:16:14,068
<font color="white">-破坏一点瓦砾就想赎罪？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-他是危险分子</font></font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:16:20,574 --> 00:16:22,535
<font color="white">进次郎 你还好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:16:25,663 --> 00:16:28,499
<font color="white">你们不见才是为地球好啦</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:16:28,582 --> 00:16:30,376
<font color="white">-没错</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-就是说啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:16:30,459 --> 00:16:32,128
<font color="white">积顿</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:48,728 --> 00:16:50,229
<font color="white">他为什么要站起来？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:17:22,762 --> 00:17:25,139
<font color="white">-积顿 加油</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-被干掉吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:17:36,567 --> 00:17:37,485
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:17:58,672 --> 00:18:00,841
<font color="white">究竟发生什么事了？</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:18:00,925 --> 00:18:03,469
<font color="white">要趁这场混乱逃跑吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:18:05,137 --> 00:18:06,430
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:18:08,557 --> 00:18:10,518
<font color="white">你们在这里搞什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:18:11,143 --> 00:18:13,604
<font color="white">北斗？到底出什么事了？</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:18:13,687 --> 00:18:15,856
<font color="white">动作快 总之趁现在快走</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:18:20,236 --> 00:18:23,322
<font color="white">他一个人迎击那个大怪兽？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:18:23,405 --> 00:18:25,157
<font color="white">你干吗佩服啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:18:25,241 --> 00:18:28,911
<font color="white">因为奥特曼太过危险</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那个大怪兽才来打倒他吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:18:28,994 --> 00:18:30,246
<font color="white">根本是自作自受</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:18:30,329 --> 00:18:32,915
<font color="white">还打没胜算的仗 简直是笨蛋</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:18:32,998 --> 00:18:37,253
<font color="white">但也许那样才算是真正的英雄啊</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:18:58,524 --> 00:18:59,817
<font color="white">加油</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:19:04,613 --> 00:19:05,656
<font color="white">还没完</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:19:09,577 --> 00:19:10,995
<font color="white">我的障壁</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:19:17,835 --> 00:19:19,879
<font color="white">你在拖拖拉拉什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:19:19,962 --> 00:19:21,589
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:19:21,672 --> 00:19:23,215
<font color="white">真亏你撑过来了</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:19:24,425 --> 00:19:26,468
<font color="white">我们上吧 进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:19:26,552 --> 00:19:27,678
<font color="white">是</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:19:47,448 --> 00:19:48,824
<font color="white">各位</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:19:48,908 --> 00:19:51,035
<font color="white">进次郎、诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:19:51,118 --> 00:19:52,578
<font color="white">抱歉我们来晚了</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:19:52,661 --> 00:19:56,498
<font color="white">我可不乐见只有前辈们备受瞩目啊</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:19:57,124 --> 00:19:58,959
<font color="white">就陪陪你们吧</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:19:59,043 --> 00:20:00,252
<font color="white">我是井手</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:20:01,378 --> 00:20:03,047
<font color="white">我们夺回科学特搜队了</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:20:04,215 --> 00:20:06,467
<font color="white">我们也会负责后援</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:07,718
<font color="white">-了解</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-是</font></font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:20:07,801 --> 00:20:09,094
<font color="white">积顿又来了</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:20:11,430 --> 00:20:13,807
<font color="white">-准备上吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-是</font></font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:20:18,062 --> 00:20:19,480
<font color="white">我也能够出一份力</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:20:52,012 --> 00:20:53,889
<font color="white">这招如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:21:45,816 --> 00:21:47,109
<font color="white">好耶</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,362
<font color="white">真是优秀的助攻啊 小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:21:54,992 --> 00:21:56,910
<font color="white">我等很久了</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:21:56,994 --> 00:21:58,120
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:21:59,163 --> 00:22:01,665
<font color="white">我深感荣幸</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:22:02,583 --> 00:22:07,004
<font color="white">能够见证你们这些新世代的奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:22:07,087 --> 00:22:10,049
<font color="white">被击溃的瞬间</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:22:26,565 --> 00:22:31,028
<font color="white">奥特曼信仰将迈向终结</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：梁雪莹</font><font color="white"></font>

